Title: Night Diner
Author: Test Fixture
Draft date: October 2026

FADE IN:

EXT. ROSIE'S DINER - NIGHT

Rain hammers the neon sign. MAYA (30s), soaked, crosses the empty lot toward the door.

INT. ROSIE'S DINER - NIGHT

LOU (60s) wipes the counter. He doesn't look up.

MAYA
You still make it too strong.

LOU
(not looking up)
You still drink it.

Maya sits. Lou slides a mug across the counter.

INT. ROSIE'S DINER - BOOTH - LATER

Maya, Lou and DET. REYES crowd the booth. Nobody touches their coffee.

REYES
Somebody start talking.

MAYA
He knows what happened that night.

LOU (CONT'D)
I know what I saw.

EXT. PARKING LOT - CONTINUOUS

Maya runs to her car. Headlights sweep across her face.

FADE OUT.
